            "content" => "Every reliable agent runs on a daily discipline, and the agent's daily discipline is the routine behind every good verification.\n\nStart the day with the plan. The route, the visits, the targets, and the device, reviewed before departure. The agent who plans the day, and checks the gear, is the agent who covers the ground, and the covered ground is the program's coverage.\n\nRun the visits to the standard. Identity, GPS, photos, notes, and the same-day submission, on every visit, however busy the day. The agent who keeps the standard under pressure is the agent whose work survives audit, and the audited work is the program's trust.\n\nClose the day with the records. The visits filed, the exceptions noted, and the follow-ups listed, done before sleep. The agent who closes the day clean is the agent who starts the next day ready, and the ready agent is the productive agent.\n\nFinally, keep learning. The feedback, the rejected visits, and the better method, studied a little each week. The agent who learns a little every week compounds into an expert, and the expert agent is the program's most valuable field asset, and discipline is how the expert is made.",
