            "content" => "A nursery is only as good as its equipment and infrastructure, and nursery equipment and infrastructure is the discipline of building the nursery to work in.\n\nStart with the site. The shade, the water, the drainage, and the working area, laid out for the work. The nursery that plans the site, and builds it for the workflow, is the nursery that runs smoothly, and the smooth nursery is the productive nursery.\n\nEquip for the tasks. The trays, the watering, the tools, and the storage, matched to the batches. The nursery that equips for the tasks, and keeps the equipment maintained, is the nursery that handles the volume without the delays, and the equipped nursery is the efficient nursery.\n\nBuild for the scale. The shade structure, the water supply, and the compost area, sized for the batches planned. The nursery that builds for the scale, and not for the present alone, is the nursery that grows without rebuilding, and the scalable nursery is the growing nursery.\n\nFinally, keep it clean and safe. The equipment, the ground, and the water, maintained and sanitised. The nursery that keeps the infrastructure clean and safe is the nursery that produces healthy seedlings, and healthy seedlings are the nursery's product and its reputation.",
