            'summary' => 'The reference for the field walk.',
            'duration' => 60,
            "content" => "The farm health field manual is the reference for the field walk, and it is the discipline of carrying the answers into the field.\n\nStart with the identification. The pests, the diseases, and the deficiencies, each with the signs and the photos. The farmer who carries the identification, and matches the signs, names the problem correctly, and the correct name is half the cure.\n\nAdd the thresholds. The pest levels that demand action, and the levels that do not. The farmer who carries the thresholds, and acts only when crossed, sprays only when needed, and the needed spray is the spray that pays.\n\nInclude the controls. The cultural, the biological, and the chemical, each for the problem it solves. The farmer who carries the controls, and chooses the least harmful, controls the pest with the least damage, and the least-harmful control is the sustainable control.\n\nFinally, keep it current. The manual, revised as the pests and the seasons change. The farmer who keeps the field manual current keeps the farm's health management current, and the current management is the farm's defence, carried into every field walk.",
